            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Play the Free Demo in your Browser</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547000/extras/8ddc3e9d865127b8b22e030a5e9b7fb9.avif?t=1483532059\" width=616 height=126 /></span><br>Please follow this link to try Septic Savages right now in your browser: <br><br>The demo includes 12 levels or arcade mode along with 2 boss battles and 2 tiers of in-game powerups. Please note that the demo does not offer 2-player support.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>After encountering an alien creature in a bathroom stall, one man is propelled into a never-ending quest of sewer dwelling carnage! <i>Septic Savages</i> is a 2D, 1 or 2-player, twin-stick shooting roguelike with loads of randomized elements and hours upon hours of gameplay.<br><br>Thanks to the power of HTML5 and Construct 2 you can try a demo of <i>Septic Savages</i> right now in your browser! Please see the above announcements to give the game a whirl and decide whether or nor it's for you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4,320 different powerup combinations!</li><li>27 possible difficulty settings, from simple fun to insane brutality!</li><li>2 modes of play: an 8 level campaign and endless arcade mode!</li><li>Play alone or with a friend! Local co-op support for both modes of play.</li><li>Complete controller support!</li><li>Bosses, potions, enemies, biomes, random environments, catchy tunes, and more!</li></ul>",
